ed ions/molecules&lt;br&gt;first, then keep most bonds" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;rounded=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1940" y="3150" width="200" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s5_rs" value="Reaction scene, 4 steps:&lt;br&gt;reactants → bonds break →&lt;br&gt;atoms rearrange → products" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;ellipse;fillColor=#1ba1e2;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#006EAF;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1940" y="3245" width="200" height="75" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s5_dion" value="One metal (Li, Be, Na, Mg,&lt;br&gt;Al, K, Ca) + one non-metal&lt;br&gt;(N, O, F, P, S, Cl)?" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;rhombus;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2380" y="2800" width="240" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s5_dch" value="Charges balance?&lt;br&gt;(metal × given = non-metal × taken)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;rhombus;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2380" y="2940" width="240" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s5_shell" value="Shells from atomic number&lt;br&gt;(2, 8, 8, 2); nearest anion&lt;br&gt;receives each electron" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;rounded=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2380" y="3060" width="240" height="75" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s5_is" value="Ionic scene, 4 steps:&lt;br&gt;atoms &amp; valency → electron transfer →&lt;br&gt;ions formed → attraction" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;ellipse;fillColor=#1ba1e2;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#006EAF;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2380" y="3165" width="240" height="75" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s5_dcov" value="In the table, one molecule,&lt;br&gt;non-metals, no charges?" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;rhombus;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2820" y="2800" width="220" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s5_doct" value="Every atom ends with a full&lt;br&gt;shell (8, or 2 for H)?" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;rhombus;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2820" y="2930" width="220" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s5_pairs" value="Bonds from RDKit; shared pair =&lt;br&gt;one electron from each atom;&lt;br&gt;lone pairs away from bonds" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;rounded=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2820" y="3060" width="220" height="75" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s5_cs" value="Covalent scene, 4 steps:&lt;br&gt;atoms → shells overlap →&lt;br&gt;sharing → full shells" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;ellipse;fillColor=#1ba1e2;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#006EAF;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2820" y="3165" width="220" height="75" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s5_err" value="SceneError with a plain reason&lt;br&gt;(e.g. &#x27;S would have 12 electrons&#x27;)&lt;br&gt;— no guessed picture" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;ellipse;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="3120" y="2930" width="220" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s5_html" value="chem3d_html(): scene JSON + player&lt;br&gt;in a sealed page (no network)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;rounded=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2380" y="3290" width="240" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s5_play" value="assets/chem3d.js: perspective 3D, shells as rings,&lt;br&gt;electrons keep their atom&#x27;s colour, Play / Back /&lt;br&gt;Next, drag to turn, zoom" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;rounded=1;fillColor=#da